// Resources linked into midstate-desktop.exe on Windows (see build.rs).
//
// The icon is what Windows shows for the program itself: in Explorer, on
// shortcuts and in the Start menu, and on a pinned taskbar entry before the
// app opens its window. The shell takes the first icon in the file.
// midstate-desktop.ico holds the logo at 16 to 256 px, drawn from
// ../logo-1024.png, the same source as the macOS app's icon.

1 ICON "midstate-desktop.ico"
